{% comment %}
  One question/answer row for the CWC PDP FAQ section's accordion.

  Not to be confused with CWC_pdp-faq-item__block, which is the buy box's inline
  FAQ block and uses the cwc_pdp-product__faq-* classes.

  Both sources — the section's FAQ Item blocks and the selected FAQ metaobject
  entries — render through here, so the two can never drift apart visually.
  Callers normalise their own field names into these parameters.

  Every row starts closed, unlike the home FAQ which opens its first one.

  Accepts:
  - question {String} - the question text.
  - answer {String} - the answer as HTML. Blocks pass richtext straight through;
    the metaobject path runs its rich text field through metafield_tag first.
  - attributes {String} - block.shopify_attributes, so the editor can select the
    row. Empty for metaobject entries, which are not editor blocks.

  Usage:
  {% render 'CWC_pdp-faq-row__block',
    question: block.settings.title,
    answer: block.settings.text,
    attributes: block.shopify_attributes
  %}
{% endcomment %}

{% if question != blank or answer != blank %}
  <div class="cwc_pdp-faq__item" {{ attributes }}>
    <button
      class="cwc_pdp-faq__question"
      type="button"
      aria-expanded="false"
      data-cwc-faq-toggle
    >
      <span class="cwc_pdp-faq__question-text">{{ question }}</span>
      <span class="cwc_pdp-faq__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </button>

    {% if answer != blank %}
      <div class="cwc_pdp-faq__answer cwc-rte">
        {{ answer }}
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
{% endif %}
